cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata below."

title: "HDT Dome and Roof Tile Identification"

type: software

authors:
  - family-names: "Wang"
    given-names: "Yang"
    affiliation: "Universitat Politècnica de València"

version: 2.0.0

date-released: 2026-11-24

repository-code: "https://github.com/wy95877-png/HDT-Dome-Tile-Identification"

abstract: >
  Dynamo and Python workflows for automated component-level identification
  of dome and roof tiles in an HBIM model. The software uses the native
  parametric organization of Revit DividedSurface elements and GridNode
  indices to generate persistent HDT component identifiers, including
  regular dome tiles, dome boundary tiles, and roof-sector tiles, and
  automatically assigns HDT-oriented instance parameters.

keywords:
  - HBIM
  - Historic Digital Twin
  - Dynamo
  - Revit
  - DividedSurface
  - GridNode
  - component identification
  - semantic enrichment
  - openBIM
